[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14762.229, "timestamp": "04:06:02", "text": "东西。是的。是的。我现在喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14764.15, "timestamp": "04:06:04", "text": "最近我买了个新的麦克风来修理我的麦克风。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14767.03, "timestamp": "04:06:07", "text": "一。等我修好网络之后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14769.349, "timestamp": "04:06:09", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14771.349, "timestamp": "04:06:11", "text": "是的。如果我修好我的网络和笔记本电脑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14773.83, "timestamp": "04:06:13", "text": "我觉得我会说，我可以做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14775.51, "timestamp": "04:06:15", "text": "尽管。之后我会转换。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14777.57, "timestamp": "04:06:17", "text": "尝试买一台新笔记本电脑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14778.91, "timestamp": "04:06:18", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14782.95, "timestamp": "04:06:22", "text": "是的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14785.67, "timestamp": "04:06:25", "text": "而我想要的感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14787.99, "timestamp": "04:06:27", "text": "就像你一样，这里蕴藏着巨大的潜力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14790.15, "timestamp": "04:06:30", "text": "现在就对本地观众说，一切都好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14792.389, "timestamp": "04:06:32", "text": "面向普通观众等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14794.95, "timestamp": "04:06:34", "text": "现在人们会表演这些小品什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14797.51, "timestamp": "04:06:37", "text": "用他们自己的语言和方言"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14799.99, "timestamp": "04:06:39", "text": "以及所有美好的事物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14802.15, "timestamp": "04:06:42", "text": "你可以用这些材料做很多事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14803.67, "timestamp": "04:06:43", "text": "管道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14805.83, "timestamp": "04:06:45", "text": "是的。人们并没有尝试去做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14808.229, "timestamp": "04:06:48", "text": "就是这样。唯一，唯一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14810.309, "timestamp": "04:06:50", "text": "我不做那件事的原因是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14812.87, "timestamp": "04:06:52", "text": "大概吧，我不太想要我的州"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14814.229, "timestamp": "04:06:54", "text": "观众。我的意思是，我确实更喜欢这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14816.349, "timestamp": "04:06:56", "text": "就像你知道的，试图找到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14818.87, "timestamp": "04:06:58", "text": "完美的观众。更像是我"}]